    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听【Two Naggers 太内个了】</span><br><span>这是一档摄影主题的闲聊播客，</span><br><span>我们是两个爱碎碎念的拍照的人，</span><br><span>假借摄影之名，大放厥词</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：2ric、pichan（根据本期出场顺序）</span><br><span>本期后期：2ric</span><br><span>背景音乐：pichan created by SUNO</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期聊了：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 在小红书发现大家在评论区很喜欢发自己的照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a> 什么时候开始接受自己是普通人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 你现在还会拍天空吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 拍天空和拍猫猫狗狗一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 秋分，是拍悬日的日子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 卢浮宫怎么拍&lt;蒙娜丽莎&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a> 还会执着于拍“好”照片吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2238">37:18</a> 到底有多少“世纪晚霞”?</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听本期节目</span><br><span>以上全部内容仅代表主播拙见</span><br><span>如果你认为我们聊的太内个了</span><br><span>请在评论区留下你的想法</span></p>]]></description>
