    <title>03 人生专辑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65bb7abbdde969cfdc35c872</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65bb7abbdde969cfdc35c872</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Feb 2024 11:04:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听【Two Naggers 太内个了】</span><br><span>这是一档摄影主题的闲聊播客，</span><br><span>我们是两个爱碎碎念的拍照的人，</span><br><span>假借摄影之名，大放厥词</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：2ric、pichan（根据声音顺序）</span><br><span>本期后期：pichan</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span><br><span>本期聊了：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Pichan要先复盘一下，觉得郭老师肯定挣到钱了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> 完颜慧德和她的纪录片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a> Pichan23年下半年比较关注创作的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a> 人生专辑 之 张悬&lt;神的游戏&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 2ric如何定义人生专辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">16:38</a> 人生专辑 之 齐豫 <c'est la="" vie=""></c'est></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1251">20:51</a> 概念专辑是什么？第一张是郭敬明&lt;迷藏&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">29:23</a> Pichan讲了别人的人生专辑故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1837">30:37</a> 蔡依林2024年6月的太原演唱会酒店涨价了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1977">32:57</a> 人生专辑 之 蔡依林<ugly beauty=""></ugly></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 人生专辑 之 Madonna<confessions on="" a="" dance="" floor=""></confessions></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a> 王菲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a> Pichan的加班专辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2350">39:10</a> Christina Aguilera</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2392">39:52</a> Katy Perry</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2519">41:59</a> 英国五月天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2676">44:36</a> 人生专辑 之 Jason Mraz<we sing.="" we="" dance.="" steal="" things.=""></we></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2735">45:35</a> 2ric分享看演唱会做到好位置的Tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2844">47:24</a> 2ric给Jason Mraz扔纸条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2911">48:31</a> James Blunt</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3112">51:52</a> Kings of Convenience</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3225">53:45</a> Angus &amp; Julia Stone</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3317">55:17</a> 格莱美音乐节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3506">58:26</a> 五条人和张玮玮与郭龙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3592">59:52</a> Mariah Carey</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3822">63:42</a> 2ric当黄牛失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3935">65:35</a> 演唱会太贵了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4022">67:02</a> 橘洲音乐节之吴青峰竖中指</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4211">70:11</a> 会预测得出将红的艺人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4300">71:40</a> Pichan去了女巫店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4402">73:22</a> 看演出会拍吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听本期节目</span><br><span>以上全部内容仅代表主播拙见</span><br><span>如果你认为我们聊的太内个了</span><br><span>请在评论区留下你的想法</span></p>]]></description>
