    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听【Two Naggers 太内个了】</span><br><span>这是一档摄影主题的闲聊播客，</span><br><span>我们是两个爱碎碎念的拍照的人，</span><br><span>假借摄影之名，大放厥词</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：2ric、pichan（根据声音顺序）</span><br><span>本期后期：2ric</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-</span><br><span></span><br><span></span></strong><span>这期聊了：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 上线了第一期就有了雄心壮志以及对商业化的思考</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 从假唱聊到网络爆红人物和迅速滑落</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> &nbsp;优秀的命理大师是与时俱进的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1508">25:08</a> &nbsp;pichan为什么想搬去杭州？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1714">28:34</a> &nbsp;记录是人人都可以创作的题材</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">33:54</a> &nbsp;过度关注就是一种窥伺和自恋</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2538">42:18</a> &nbsp;摄影具有仪式感还是劳动方法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2694">44:54</a> &nbsp;上海男人是全国最会撒娇的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a> &nbsp;深圳是最有塑料感的城市</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3066">51:06</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;你还会用胶片模拟类App吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3405">56:45</a> &nbsp;2ric什么时候开始有偶像包袱的？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4109">1:08:29</a> &nbsp;盘点一下2023</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听本期节目</span><br><span>以上全部内容仅代表主播拙见</span><br><span>如果你认为我们聊的太内个了</span><br><span>请在评论区留下你的想法</span></p>]]></description>
